\" src=\"assets/wiki/Robson_d04b24.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Postman\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Robson%27s%20Isle\">Robson Isle</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<p>The following amount of creatures can be found approximately:\n</p>\n<ul><li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Banshee\">Banshee</a></li>\n<li>~12 <a href=\"#/wiki/Bog%20Raider\">Bog Raiders</a></li>\n<li>~12 <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonebeast\">Bonebeasts</a></li>\n<li>~5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Elemental\">Earth Elementals</a></li>\n<li>3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spiders</a></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Mutated%20Human\">Mutated Humans</a></li>\n<li>~10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Mutated%20Rat\">Mutated Rats</a></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare%20Scion\">Nightmare Scion</a></li>\n<li>3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Nightstalker\">Nightstalkers</a></li>\n<li>~10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Tarantula\">Tarantulas</a></li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tarantula\"><img alt=\"Tarantula\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tarantula_509bfa.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Tarantula\">Tarantula</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">120</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">225</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">92</td><td style=\"font-size: s